    "updated_at": "2022-03-14T17:48:02Z",
    "body": "A similar issue has been already discussed in #3377 and @fred-wang has been working on making chrome pass these tests. I had the impression that FF was passing them as well. \r\n\r\n@annevk maybe you could provide some feedback about the mentioned PR I've just landed, hopefully aligned with what you had in mind when you defined the tests. It'd be also interesting to know details about the current status of the FF implementation and whether there is already a bug that may explain the interoperability issue.\r\n",
